#             schema, Hasura, Supabase edge functions with custom schemas, Rails apps
#             using db:schema, etc.).  The schema enumeration path in _discover_tables
#             also had this bug but only partially (it at least returned public tables
#             for default apps); in _error_enum_tables every non-public schema target
#             silently produced 0 tables and aborted before column/dump phases.
#             Fix: replace `schemaname='public'` with `schemaname=current_schema()`
#             which dynamically resolves to the active search_path schema for the
#             current database session.
#
