# and therefore ALWAYS fail. This means Boolean, Timing, WB, NV, EX, HY, ST, UE injections
# detected via the cascade engine are NEVER confirmed. Fix: set _PCV_IN_PROGRESS[0]=True
# before PCV probes begin and False in a finally block so _send_injected allows them through.
#
# BUG-PCV-REFCOUNT FIX: Changed from boolean (False/True) to INTEGER REFERENCE COUNTER.
