                        # FIX-REQ3-WF-OVERFLOW: round(v * 1000) can equal 1000 for values
                        # like v=0.9999 (floating-point rounding: round(999.9)=1000).
                        # f"0:0:0.{1000:03d}" → "0:0:0.1000" (4 digits) — invalid T-SQL.
                        # SQL Server rejects WAITFOR DELAY '0:0:0.1000'; use integer-seconds
                        # form for any value that rounds to exactly 1000ms (= 1 full second).
